[en.FOCUS_C01_C04_OPERATION_REDSKY]
Operation <=Redsky=>

[en.FOCUS_C01_C04_OPERATION_REDSKY_desc]
Stratusburg, a small city of no importance to the Empire. Whether it is in Cloudsdale documents, Empire tax reports, or even the Empire Air Force files, the ink Stratusburg is worth is never more than a few footnotes.\nHowever, in contrast to Stratusbur’s insignificance, there is their governer - Spitfire. Spitfire is known for her rebelliousness, and the number of times her name appears in Empire documents far exceeds that of Stratusburg itself.\nSpitfire is not important to the Empire, Stratusburg is not important to the Empire either, but the destruction of Spitfire is important to the Empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_OPERATION_REDSKY]
「赤穹」行动

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_OPERATION_REDSKY_desc]
层云堡，对于帝国来说无足轻重的一个小城市。在云中城相关协议，或是帝国税收报表，甚至即使是帝国空军的文件中，层云堡所值得的篇幅也不过是几句注脚。\n然而，与层云堡的无关紧要相对的，是他们的市长——喷火。喷火以她的反抗性闻名，她的名字在帝国的文件中出现的次数，远远超过了层云堡本身。\n喷火对帝国不重要，层云堡对帝国也不重要，但是没有喷火，对帝国很重要。

